<title>TURKEY: TURKEY'S Q1 GNP UP 5.7 PERCENT FROM YEAR EARLIER.</title>
<headline>TURKEY'S Q1 GNP UP 5.7 PERCENT FROM YEAR EARLIER.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's gross national product rose 5.7 percent year-on-year in the first quarter, the state statistics office said.</p>
</text>
